"更新文件验证或准备失败（%@）。" = "Update verification or preparation failed (%@).";
"1. 在系统设置中启用增强右键的 Finder 扩展。\n2. 使用范围在通用设置中选择，普通目录无需逐个授权。\n3. 若受保护的位置无法访问，在「隐私与安全性 → 完全磁盘访问权限」中添加并启用当前的增强右键.app。\n4. 权限变更后退出并重新打开增强右键。" = "1. Enable the Enhanced Right Click Finder extension in System Settings.\n2. Choose the disk scope in General; ordinary folders do not require individual grants.\n3. If protected locations cannot be accessed, add and enable the current app in Privacy & Security > Full Disk Access.\n4. Quit and reopen the app after permission changes.";
"在访达目录空白处右键，打开「新建文件」，选择模板即可创建。\n\n在设置中勾选「主菜单」，可以把该模板直接放到右键菜单。双击名称可修改菜单文字，拖动行可调整顺序。\n\n点击「添加模版文件」可导入自己的模板。" = "Right-click empty space in a Finder folder, open New File and choose a template.\n\nEnable Main Menu to show a template directly in the context menu. Double-click a name to edit it and drag rows to reorder.\n\nUse Add template file to import your own template.";
"1. 在系统设置中启用增强右键的 Finder 扩展。\n2. 在「通用设置 → 使用范围」中确认包含当前目录。\n3. 在「新建文件」中启用至少一个模板，在访达目录空白处重新打开右键菜单。\n4. 扩展已启用但菜单仍未出现时，可退出并重新打开增强右键。" = "1. Enable the Enhanced Right Click Finder extension in System Settings.\n2. Check that General > Disk Scope includes the current folder.\n3. Enable at least one template in New File, then reopen the context menu in empty space.\n4. If the extension is enabled but the menu is missing, quit and reopen the app.";
